WEBVTT

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.380
Avrora.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.900
Avrorushka.

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.310
Good morning, Avrora.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.200
Who are you?

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.700
Why do you know my name?

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.700
Because you are a friend of Kojou.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:30.260
Kojou..?

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:33.860
Yes. Akatsuki Kojou.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:39.350
The most powerful vampire in the world. The boy called the Fourth Progenitor.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.490
But vampires are just a fantasy, aren't they?

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.400
They don't really exist.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.630
You are right. There are no vampires on this island.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.710
So wake up early,

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.000
twelfth, Avrora.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.650
Akatsuki-senpai!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.390
What is the purpose of the First Progenitor?

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:58.700
I don't think it's just to embarrass Akatsuki Kojou that he recovered the Za-Blood Beasts.

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.600
He made a deal with the senpai.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:06.200
He granted him the power to save Avrora from the Node

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.540
and thus stop the Node's threat to this world.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.700
That's why we now have the
Za-Blood Beasts here then.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:19.000
If we gather 12 blood mates of the Progenitor, he will be able to tame the Familiars.

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:21.400
However, if we fail...

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.950
This island will be destroyed
by the fury of the Familiars

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:27.750
and the portal of the Node will thus disappear.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.700
A brutal way of solving the problem.

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:34.430
He is like that.
He has always been an intriguer.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:37.200
You are...

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.100
Chaos Bride?!

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:42.870
Don't call me whit that formal name.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:46.100
I prefer Giada, Minamiya Natsuki.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:49.560
You have to gather 12 blood mates

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:54.470
and so he will be able to subdue
those horrible Beasts.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.620
But the question is whether that boy...

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.760
will be able to get twelve blood mates.

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.350
We can do it.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:05.500
With enough time, we will succeed.

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:07.870
Understood.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:13.520
I'll grant you half a day to do it.

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.100
Alteration of space?

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:32.280
No, you carried him into
the dimension of your Familiar,

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:33.900
Giada Kukulcan!

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:40.440
For me too, keeping him
sealed takes a lot of effort.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:42.590
At midnight.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:48.500
Gather the twelve sacrifices by midnight today.

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:52.240
Until then, I'll take care of Akatsuki Kojou.

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:54.200
We appreciate your help, Giada.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.970
I have high expectations of you.

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:02.710
Try not to let me down, young kennagi.

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:21.300
That's fine. Come back here, Glenda.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:22.600
Da!

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:25.100
Cain, what are you doing?

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:29.510
What is this absurdly complicated magic circle?

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:31.400
What kind of magic are you using?

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:33.200
Look and you will know.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:52.400
It works?!

00:05:57.950 --> 00:05:58.930
It did not work..?

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.700
Damn you, Cain!

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:03.200
You were bringing that puppet to life!

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:06.100
Yes, but I failed.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.600
That forbidden spell...

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.200
Do you want to subvert the rules of this world?

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.800
What is your purpose?

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.650
It's obvious, isn't it?

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.400
Save the world using my skills.

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:19.940
Save the world with forbidden magic?

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:21.600
Damn you!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.130
How can you be so arrogant?

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:24.250
More than forbidden magic, I would call it... Seisen.
How can you be so arrogant?

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.250
More than forbidden magic, I would call it... Seisen.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:28.610
Seisen?

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.520
It's the name of this power.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.780
It's magnificent, isn't it, Giada?

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:34.100
It's ridiculous!

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.050
What is this?

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:39.050
Giada...

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.150
Am I seeing the memories of the Third Progenitor?

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:47.710
It's amazing that even locked up
here, you can be conscious.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.150
Giada?

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.650
Giada Kukulcan?

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:56.760
And what's more, you're browsing my memories, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:59.300
Why were you with Cain?

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.100
Don't tell me... Are those memories of the Node?

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.570
Is this what you want to ask me?

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:07.460
You should already know the answer.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.600
It's the curse of the Fourth Progenitor.

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:13.600
You, who have the memories inherited from that blood, know the truth.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.380
You can continue to delve into these Seisen's memories if you want

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:24.920
and then curse what you received from the monster who is the Fourth Progenitor.

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:27.020
This is your destiny.

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:31.680
What's going on there?

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:32.950
They are all very beautiful.

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.350
Maybe they are actresses?

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.000
They are recording a Dorama?

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:38.390
But there are no cameras...

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:41.620
and the atmosphere seems tense.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:46.800
So?

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:50.000
Natsuki-chan, I came here
because you asked me, but...

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:54.800
Gathering all of Kojou's acquaintances here, what do you want to achieve?

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:58.290
Will you lock us up somewhere
for killing each other?

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:01.900
Oh, this would be interesting.

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:05.430
If so, you would be the first to be killed, though.

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:08.350
Would it suit you, Priestess of Cain?

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:10.920
Here... Sorry, who are you?

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:18.930
Don't laugh Shio-chan. It's rude to Kisaki-san.

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:22.060
However, after provoking it so much,

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.790
she doesn't even know her. Can you think?

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:30.730
Right, I apologize for not introducing myself.

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.550
I am Kisaki Kiriha from Taishikyoku.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:40.150
Using Eguchi Yume I tried to destroy Blue Elysium and kill you.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:43.650
With this, does anything come back to your mind?

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:47.460
Oh... something like this certainly happened.

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:50.800
But there are so many who threaten my life that I had forgotten it.

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:57.850
Now that I remember. I also went to an
outdoor hot spring with Akatsuki Kojou.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.350
What is this all about?
I want to know everything!

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:04.050
Yuki, is that true?

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:07.200
Ah, well... it's not entirely untrue.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:09.200
Himeragi, is that okay with you?

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:13.350
This is... How to say...
A lot of things have happened.

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:16.110
Oh, they've all come together already.

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:17.760
Sorry for the wait.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:20.170
Who are you?

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:23.400
You were right to ask,
girl with the malevolent look.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:29.450
I am the great alchemist who used the blood of the Magnus Opus to achieve immortality.

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:32.100
I am Nina Adelard.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:35.500
Nina ..? The legendary alchemist?

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:37.850
Why is a being like you here?

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:41.600
Furthermore... You are Kanase Kanon, right?

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:43.730
Yes, that's me.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.550
Excuse me, I'm late.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.600
There's no reason to apologize.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.630
What do we owe this meeting to?

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:56.450
If the idea is to lock up us
to kill each other, I'm in.

00:09:56.720 --> 00:10:00.200
Oh sorry. We have already
finished talking about this.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:04.550
Eh?! Did you finish talking about it,
even though I just got here?

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:06.500
I demand an explanation!

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:08.580
You are right, of course.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.770
I should start explaining to you.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:13.010
We do not have much time.

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.510
Stop talking nonsense.

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:19.800
In short, I'm sorry, but you must all become Akatsuki Kojou's brides.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.650
B-Brides?!

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:30.500
The kind of bride who lives and has children with him?  That kind of bride?!

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:33.450
Are you asking us to marry Akatsuki Kojou?

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:36.850
Don't fret. It won't be a real wedding.

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:40.450
It is only for this night that
you will have to stay with him.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:45.040
Only for one night?!
S-Such a vulgar relationship...

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:48.250
As a Paladiness of Gisela I cannot accept it!

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.880
S-She's right! And what about
the ceremony and the banquet?

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.620
Wait, Shio-chan...

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:56.110
Kasuko-chan... right?

00:10:56.600 --> 00:11:00.950
With bride, I think she is
referring to a blood mate.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:04.820
Eh?! S-So, who shared blood with him?

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:07.500
What other meaning should it have?

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:10.800
You said it on purpose so that it would be misunderstood, right?

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:14.450
Because I wanted to see your reaction.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:18.300
However, Kojou has now become a normal human being, hasn't he?

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:21.350
Why are blood mates needed?

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:25.000
He hasn't returned to being
completely human, has he?

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:28.800
The Fourth Progenitor's Beasts have been given to Avrora, though...

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:32.500
his body hasn't become human again.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:33.850
Am I right?

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:39.800
Yes. And it is in this unstable
condition that to Senpai,

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:44.640
the First Progenitor's mate
passed on the Beasts of Za-Blood.

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:54.550
However, in this state Akatsuki-senpai is unable to control the Familiars.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:59.000
And he doesn't even have enough magic to hold them back for long.

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:03.850
Oh! Is blood mates necessary for this then?

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:08.000
Nina-san, can you use this and divide it into rings?

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.650
We need eleven if possible.

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:13.350
What? That's silver gray!

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.900
A truly rare precious metal.

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:18.650
Incho-sama, you're starting to drool.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:23.000
But I feel that there's something mixed with the metal.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:25.400
Theres Kojou's blood and flesh.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:30.560
I get it. You want to use them as
catalysts to create a spiritual bond.

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:36.100
Including me, bringing together 12 blood mates,

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:41.000
Akatsuki-senpai will be able
to control Za-Blood's Beasts.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:44.110
Which means that in essence we are sacrifices.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:47.450
An offer for those familiars
who are about to break free.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:50.620
Of course, if you don't want to participate, we don't oblige you.

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:54.370
Therefore we beseech you with bowed heads.

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:59.570
That it's a cat to bow its head does not convince me of its sincerity.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:03.900
However, when Akatsuki's Beasts go out of control,

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:06.850
this island will be completely destroyed.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:13.600
All right. Then I offer myself as a sacrifice.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:17.700
Kojou has already drank my blood, after all.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:20.000
Shizuri-chan, you can't unfortunately.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:21.500
W-Why not?!

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:25.750
You have four broken ribs
and a left arm ulna fracture,

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.500
as well as bruises, sprains and muscle tears.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:31.750
While you have the stamina
of an Orc, you have your limits.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:36.630
And now even the magic that was provided as a privilege of the Lords is beginning to run out.

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:39.000
But as Paladiness, I still have Gisela's blessing!

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:40.590
Incho-sama...

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:44.180
Can I have a ring please?

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:48.100
Sure. There is one just your size.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:53.000
Yukina-san, we're the same now.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:59.500
Li-Listen... I want to be Kojou's bride too!

00:14:04.140 --> 00:14:07.300
How cruel, Minamiya-sensei!

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:12.210
I forgot to mention it. You two little girls are excluded from the matter.

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:15.390
It's true. They are still in elementary school.

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:18.800
If they did it, we'd give him a license as a pervert.

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:22.650
But then, why did you bring us here too?

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:23.590
As a joke.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:28.800
The fate of this island is at stake, this is no time for some jokes!

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:34.850
Certainly. There are many lives
at stake on Itogami Island.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:39.160
A Lion King dancer shouldn't
hesitate over personal matters.

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:41.800
Hikawa Shio?

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:44.030
That's how it is then.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.350
After all, Shio-chan, you like Kojou-kun too.

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:51.000
You are wrong! I'll do it
because I'm a dancer of the—

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.600
Shio-chan... you too?
Why did you say so, Yuiri?

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:57.150
Yuki, can I get one too?

00:14:57.520 --> 00:15:00.480
Kojou-kun sucked my blood once too.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.540
And... it's not like it bothered me.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.430
What did you say?

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:09.350
So really, that's what happened that time.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:10.700
What, really?

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:15.380
So, could you give it this shape?

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:18.800
I wish it had a Rag jewelry style look.

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:21.590
You're not really ashamed to ask, are you Kiriha?

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:26.950
Hey, why do you want a ring too, Kisaki Kiriha?

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:31.610
Being a blood mate of the Fourth Progenitor grants considerable power.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:35.120
I can't give the Lion King the monopoly, can I?

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:40.980
Furthermore,, Akatsuki Kojou and I have already related, naked.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:43.400
I have to take responsibility for it.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:49.200
Yukina! Me too!  Akatsuki Kojou
sucked my blood too!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:55.550
Oh, what a pity. Apparently there are no rings left for you, Kirasaka Sayaka-kun.

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:59.550
This is not true!
Only four were awarded, right?!

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:04.700
Wait a moment. I want one too.
Give me one too!

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:07.640
My, my... with these we have six.

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:10.380
And if she joins too, there will be seven.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:13.700
It's already good that we
have more than half of them.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:17.400
Ah, enough, give up!

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:24.610
Do you know any others Akatsuki sucked blood from?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.200
As far as I know...

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:30.200
there are still Astarte-san and Glenda-san.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.050
Glenda?! Such a young girl?

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:35.550
It-It's not what you think!

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.400
I mean, it's true, but...

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:41.240
At that moment Glenda-san looked like me,

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.800
and so the senpai got confused and...

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:46.800
And did you believe such a pathetic excuse?

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:47.800
Naive.

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:52.200
By the way, Glenda...

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:54.300
Wasn't she with Kasuko-san?

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:57.920
While I was treating Shizuri-chan, she disappeared.

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:01.580
Glenda..? Why?

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:04.600
Astarte cannot become his blood mate,

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:08.340
since she must already feed the familiar she has within herself.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.350
As for Glenda, on the other hand, I have no idea.

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:13.840
That dragon girl anyway, where is she?

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:16.900
This... we don't even know.

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.350
Since she is very attached to Kojou,

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:22.300
I thought she would come back to help, but...

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:25.100
There are other people to consider too...

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.400
Like Yuuma-san...

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:27.600
and also...

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:30.000
Aiba Asagi? You too?

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:32.770
I know Tokoyogi Yuuma, she will accept.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.850
And we are nine.

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:37.720
I'm sorry, but I will not participate.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.480
A-Aiba-senpai?!

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:45.340
Stand in line waiting for Kojou to suck the blood of each of us?

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:46.860
No, thanks.

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:48.600
Hey, Aiba Asagi,

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:51.460
I understand how you feel but the life of the
inhabitants of the Itogami island depends on...

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:56.100
If that idiot Kojou came
begging me on his knees,

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:57.710
I might as well think about it.

00:17:58.200 --> 00:17:59.050
But above all,

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:03.920
this business of subduing the Familiars by bringing 12 of us together seems very strange to me.

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.100
But the First Progenitor said that...

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:06.840
Exactly.

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:11.140
Do you think this trivial solution
satisfies the Progenitors?

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:18.400
You already have something in mind, right?

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.700
There's no guarantee it'll be fine, though.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.380
So I don't oblige anyone.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:27.480
Well, it's better than this idea of a Kojou's forced harem anyway,

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:29.500
or at least that's what I think.

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.350
If it's Jotei-domo's idea,

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:34.500
Yume-dono and I can help too!

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:37.800
What are we to do, Asagi-oneesan?!

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:41.160
I don't like it at all, Aiba Asagi.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.540
After all,

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:47.000
I should have blown you up
with the Blue Elysium.

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:48.550
Thank you,

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:50.650
I'll take that as a compliment.

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:52.260
Aiba-senpai!

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:03.480
I knew that Iblis had grown fond
of a young human girl, but...

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:05.250
Now I understand.

00:19:05.550 --> 00:19:07.580
It was you, yes...

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:08.980
Priestess of Cain?

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:12.400
I apologize for the sudden visit.

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:15.960
I'm here to ask you a favor, your highness.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.110
Speak then, yes.

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:19.100
Then...

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:23.200
Regarding the selection of
the Lord of the island Itogami,

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:29.050
I would like the title to be awarded to the Lord of
Saikai Academy domain, Kasugaya Shizuri Castiella.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:37.150
Are you asking me to serve that Orc girl, right?

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:38.420
Exactly.

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:41.150
Who does that human think she is? What arrogance!

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:43.400
Friend of the prince or not, that's unforgivable!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.870
Obviously, it would not be without a counterpart.

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:49.700
I intend to offer you compensation.

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:54.330
Something that satisfies me,
that reigns over a domain.

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:58.290
Do you think you can offer it to me? Really?

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:00.250
C-Certainly!

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:01.850
It's true, Aiba-san?

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:02.720
Obviously.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:05.110
It's interesting, yes.

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:07.610
What is that?

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:11.650
A curry!

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:20.300
From the most delicious and famous restaurant on the Itogami island,

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:23.350
on the East of the island, for you the European recipe of Relulu!

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:26.130
A masterpiece served in just 20 portions a day,

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:29.200
but being a regular customer, I had a whole pot of it!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.450
A-Aiba-san!

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:32.700
Are you idiot? Are you crazy?

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.650
It's a deal we're looking for here, you know?

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:35.640
I advise you,

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:38.840
Relulu's curry is really hard to book.

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:42.360
Even princes and nobles have a hard time tasting it.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:45.250
Even the gastronomic authority of the Itogami island,

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:47.420
Ozawa-san would go on to enjoy it!

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:50.050
But who cares?

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:52.200
Besides, who is this Ozawa-san?

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:00.500
A curry?!

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:04.190
Will you offer me curry in
exchange for my submission?

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:11.730
I hadn't laughed so much in years!

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:15.060
On this island, you really don't get bored, do you?

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.300
What you think, Shogun?

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:19.450
Once,

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:24.220
spices were traded at prices
comparable to gold or silver, right?

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:27.400
So, after all, this curry which is the apotheosis of spices,

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:31.450
it's a proper homage for a king, isn't it?

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:32.290
Certainly.

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:33.990
So be it.

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:35.960
Tonight,

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:38.350
the Dynasty of Destruction,

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:41.860
will recognize the young Castiella as his Lord.

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:45.400
However, I have a condition.

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:49.070
You attend my gala dinner. Yes?

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:51.400
While we will taste your curry,

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:56.130
you will explain to me in detail
the plot you are preparing, yes?

00:21:56.850 --> 00:21:57.880
With pleasure.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:00.300
Astarte,

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:02.270
how is the evacuation of residents going?

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:06.640
There are no civilians within a radius of at least 1.5 kilometers.

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:08.830
The roads leading here are blocked.

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:13.600
The percentage of the population
protected by the magic barrier is 90%.

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:16.440
That's the best the Magic Defense Committee can do.

00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:19.870
Do we have any chance of success, Witch of the Void?

00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:21.650
Why are you asking me?

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:26.300
The initiative of this plan belongs to one of your students, right?

00:22:26.300 --> 00:22:30.650
Unfortunately, if she doesn't
come back in time I can't know,

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:32.350
Sorry!

00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:33.500
We're late!

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:36.800
Are you all right, Yuiri?

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:37.810
I'm fine.

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:40.650
But with all that curry, my stomach...

00:22:41.100 --> 00:22:41.880
Astarte.

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:47.520
Since Akatsuki Kojou is unstable and can't
control his magic, summon your Familiar now,

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:49.700
endangers your life.

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:51.630
You know this, right?

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:52.700
Affirmative.

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:55.970
To optimize the success of the operation,

00:22:56.300 --> 00:22:59.840
the use of the Familiar will be limited to what is necessary and for a short time.

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:02.080
I'm counting on you.

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:03.500
Accept.

00:23:17.880 --> 00:23:20.200
Astarte, what time is it?

00:23:20.200 --> 00:23:21.980
11:40 pm.

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:23.300
At the beginning of the operation,

00:23:23.700 --> 00:23:25.110
there are twenty minutes left.

00:25:02.350 --> 00:25:03.300
Very well!

00:25:03.500 --> 00:25:06.780
A dish with eggplant and chilli.
What a nice smell!

00:25:06.920 --> 00:25:10.000
Actually, I don't like spicy dishes, but

00:25:10.000 --> 00:25:12.500
I don't like meat very much, so...

00:25:12.500 --> 00:25:14.020
And you, Glenda, what are you eating?

00:25:14.300 --> 00:25:18.100
I have these. I bought them
before I came to class.

00:25:18.890 --> 00:25:19.830
But that's not fair!

00:25:20.080 --> 00:25:23.000
Donuts for lunch? But is it allowed?

00:25:23.300 --> 00:25:27.050
Of course yes! Because I'm
the one who decides it.

00:25:30.100 --> 00:25:32.700
Ava, you are kind but a little too stiff.

00:25:33.100 --> 00:25:36.100
Now you can live more freely.

00:25:36.100 --> 00:25:36.940
Freely?

00:25:37.650 --> 00:25:40.420
Don't forget what you've always wanted.

00:25:41.300 --> 00:25:44.260
Because this is the key to
remembering who you really are.

00:25:44.650 --> 00:25:45.750
Glenda...?

00:25:45.750 --> 00:25:46.700
Get one!

00:25:51.550 --> 00:25:52.920
Say, Ava...

00:25:54.000 --> 00:25:55.350
Avrorushka...

00:25:56.050 --> 00:25:57.000
Did you know that?

00:25:57.250 --> 00:25:58.780
Somewhere in this school,

00:25:59.100 --> 00:26:02.220
there seems to be a room that
contains all the secrets of the world.

00:26:02.660 --> 00:26:04.510
The secrets of the world?

00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:10.100
If you find that room, you can recover important memories that you have forgotten.

00:26:11.500 --> 00:26:13.630
Kojou would certainly be happy too.

00:26:14.200 --> 00:26:15.080
Kojou?

00:26:15.650 --> 00:26:18.100
You will look for it, won't you, Avrora?
